v 3
d gracedr - Group-adaptive randomization with a study folder
d
d gracedr is the Stata version of graceDR. It defines a study in a folder, randomizes
d participants one at a time with the modified minimal sufficient balance method,
d reports balance, keeps an audit log, and simulates trials under several methods.
d
d Requires Stata 19.
d Distribution-Date: 20261115
d
d Example files: type net get gracedr to copy them to the current folder.
d
